repository-code: 'https://github.com/adrhill/asdex'
url: 'https://adrianhill.de/asdex/'
abstract: >-
  asdex (pronounced Aztecs) exploits sparsity structure to
  efficiently materialize Jacobians and Hessians. It
  implements a custom Jaxpr interpreter that uses abstract
  interpretation to detect sparsity patterns from the
  computation graph, then uses graph coloring to minimize
  the number of AD passes needed.
